<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cooper Cameron started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cooper Cameron started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merill Lynch said Monday it started coverage of oil services company Cooper Cameron Corp with an intermediate-term rating of accumulate and a long-term rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Houston-based company closed at 55-12/16.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
